This package includes material derived from the following works.

## libaribcaption

The caption character tables (src/b24-tables.ts) are derived from libaribcaption
(b24_conv_tables.hpp, b24_gaiji_table.hpp, b24_colors.cpp, b24_drcs_conv.cpp),
and the caption decoder (src/b24caption.ts) is a TypeScript port of its
decoder_impl.cpp. https://github.com/xqq/libaribcaption

